          Geopolitical volatility: 5 levers to turn it into a competitive advantage
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-200 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Instability is no longer an episode. It is the permanent context in which executives have to decide. A PerfEco reading of McKinsey Quarterly — June 2026.
